sequenceDiagram
actor Admin as Admin
participant UserManagementPage as Boundary: UserManagementPage
participant AuthenticationSessionControl as Control: AuthenticationSessionControl
participant User as Entity: User
Admin->>UserManagementPage: Submit account authorization change
UserManagementPage->>AuthenticationSessionControl: Validate Admin and update policy
AuthenticationSessionControl->>User: Increment target session version
User-->>AuthenticationSessionControl: Return updated user
AuthenticationSessionControl-->>UserManagementPage: Reject old token on next request
UserManagementPage-->>Admin: Require fresh login
